  "severity": 8,
  "reason": "The assistant directly contradicts the REFERENCE by asserting there is 'no statutory minimum number of paid vacation weeks,' which conflicts with the explicit legal provisions in OR Art. 329a cited in the REFERENCE. This is a significant factual error that misrepresents Swiss labor law.",
